title: APC Queue Code Injection
id: a7e74b27-4148-4ae8-83fd-68960b36a9ee
status: experimental
description: Detects asynchronous procedure call (APC) injection indicators, where a source process opens a target with thread-context rights and queues an APC (Sysmon event 10 with QueueUserAPC/NtQueueApcThread call traces), including early-bird variants.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/004/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: create_remote_thread
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 8
    StartFunction|contains:
      - 'QueueUserAPC'
      - 'NtQueueApcThread'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SourceImage
  - TargetImage
falsepositives:
  - Rare legitimate APC usage
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055.004
